          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "વઘારવું — vaghārvũ — \"to temper (with hot spiced oil)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "માતાએ રાઈ અને જીરાથી દાળ વઘારી. mātāe rāī ane jīrāthī dāḷ vaghārī. Mother tempered the dal with mustard seed and cumin."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with તેણે (he or she …): તેણે દાળ વઘારી, teṇe dāḷ vaghārī."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "વઘારવું (vaghārvũ) is inherited from Sanskrit vyághārayati, \"sprinkles over\", and CDIAL lists the Gujarati verb, \"to season\" (CDIAL 12191): hot oil with spices is poured over the dish."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
